#{[{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186129124 :knowledge-point/canonical-example {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186128879 :knowledge-point/_canonical-example [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "5696c2d5-4e35-5ed3-a4a2-6fe9b158e461" :knowledge-point/title "Finding the Range of a Transformed Sinusoidal Function"}] :question/id #uuid "61b6821f-3ee5-5dd8-b8a3-ee1859645237" :question/math-academy-id "e-15611" :question/problem "What is the range of the function $f(x) = -4\\cos(3x)-2?$" :question/worked-solution "The range of $\\cos x$ is\n\n$$\n-1 \\leq \\cos x \\leq 1.\n$$\n\nHorizontal shifts and stretches have no effect on the range. Therefore,\n\n$$\n-1\\leq\\cos\\left(3x \\right) \\leq 1.\n$$\n\nMultiplying the above inequality by $-4$ and then subtracting $2,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-1 & \\le \\operatorname{cos}⁡(3x)\\le 1 \\\\ 4 & \\ge -4\\operatorname{cos}⁡(3x)\\ge -4 \\\\ 2 & \\ge -4\\operatorname{cos}⁡(3x)-2\\ge -6 \\\\ -6 & \\le f(x)\\le 2.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the range is $f(x)\\in [-6,2].$"} :knowledge-point/id #uuid "5696c2d5-4e35-5ed3-a4a2-6fe9b158e461" :knowledge-point/key-prerequisites [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186049707} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186050734}] :knowledge-point/question-generator {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186531928 :question-generator/id #uuid "c3a9a8c0-3774-558d-b354-ef2d45eaf5b1" :question-generator/script "generate/scratch/17592186129124.py"} :knowledge-point/questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186129402 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "5696c2d5-4e35-5ed3-a4a2-6fe9b158e461" :knowledge-point/title "Finding the Range of a Transformed Sinusoidal Function"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "fa4dfa97-3f07-5567-8750-354f30d3bb6c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "y ∈ [- 7,-1]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186125913} {:answer/id #uuid "0762c47c-21fb-5163-a406-96a9be3d58cb" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "y ∈ [- 3, 3]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186125914} {:answer/id #uui