t :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186531876} {:answer/id #uuid "6f281784-c7e4-5d06-a98c-0a6c10d812ec" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186531885} {:answer/id #uuid "80c517f3-63d6-531c-b0a6-bdcd1da1fe53" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186531890} {:answer/id #uuid "f1adb5ae-8773-5ef7-9032-e5081b280e6b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186531924}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "46078fb0-5898-5fae-b9a4-b6e815de76f7" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186531876} :answer-field/id #uuid "a6069c40-7881-5688-89d3-045b5b38d124" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186531900}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "9ae916ed-a8c7-538e-bdc4-5c580d17a4e4" :question/problem "What is the minimum value of $f(x)=-\\cos(4x+2)+4$?" :question/worked-solution "The range of $\\cos x$ is\n\n$$\n-1\\le \\cos x\\le 1.\n$$\n\nHorizontal shifts and stretches have no effect on the range. Therefore,\n\n$$\n-1\\le \\cos(4x+2)\\le 1.\n$$\n\nMultiplying the above inequality by $-1$ and then adding $4$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & -1\\le \\cos(4x+2)\\le 1 \\\\  & 1\\ge -\\cos(4x+2)\\ge -1 \\\\  & 5\\ge -\\cos(4x+2)+4\\ge 3 \\\\  & 3\\le f(x)\\le 5.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the minimum value is $3.$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186531909 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "5696c2d5-4e35-5ed3-a4a2-6fe9b158e461" :knowledge-point/title "Finding the Range of a Transformed Sinusoidal Function"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "100bb7ef-dacf-547d-b9c3-3631982b96d3" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "y\\in [- \\frac{4}{3},\\frac{4}{3}]" :db/id #edb/re